sequenceDiagram
  actor Student
  participant Kiosk as Kiosk Scanner (React app)
  participant DB as Supabase (Postgres)
  participant Live as Live Monitor (Realtime)

  Student->>Kiosk: Show QR pass to camera
  Kiosk->>Kiosk: Decode QR code with jsQR
  Kiosk->>DB: lookup_pass_by_token(token)
  DB-->>Kiosk: student_id, pass_status
  Kiosk->>DB: record_check_in(event_id, session_id, student_id)
  DB->>DB: Check window, invite list, capacity
  DB->>DB: Insert check_ins row, compute status
  DB-->>Kiosk: outcome, checked_in_at, status
  Kiosk-->>Student: Show result card (Welcome, status)
  DB--)Live: Realtime INSERT event on check_ins
  Live-->>Live: Update live count and feed
